WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 13]

01:39.840 --> 01:41.390
If word of Blood River spreads

01:41.390 --> 01:42.660
across the jianghu,

01:43.590 --> 01:45.130
then we, with nowhere to go,

01:46.280 --> 01:47.330
will make Tianqi City

01:47.430 --> 01:48.840
our first stop.

01:50.560 --> 01:52.330
Maybe the world won't have us,

01:53.590 --> 01:54.850
but we'll...

01:56.080 --> 01:58.770
erase the Shadow Sect from this world.

02:28.750 --> 02:31.010
Fine young man...

02:31.840 --> 02:32.940
gutsy,

02:33.430 --> 02:34.220
sharp,

02:35.150 --> 02:36.940
and skilled.

02:37.590 --> 02:38.780
The moment he walked in,

02:40.360 --> 02:42.220
he sensed you were here.

02:43.630 --> 02:44.890
Didn't you try

02:44.960 --> 02:45.980
to hide your aura?

02:46.960 --> 02:47.500
You were wrong.

02:48.280 --> 02:49.890
Before he entered,

02:50.430 --> 02:51.690
I used the Breath-Concealing Art

02:52.080 --> 02:53.260
to fully conceal

02:53.310 --> 02:54.500
every trace of my aura.

02:56.590 --> 02:58.060
His skills are high.

02:59.120 --> 03:00.610
So young,

03:00.870 --> 03:01.870
and already beyond

03:01.870 --> 03:03.960
the last Su family head.

03:05.870 --> 03:07.940
If you plan to rein them in,

03:09.470 --> 03:11.610
judging by the Shadow Sect today,

03:13.000 --> 03:15.610
His Highness will be disappointed.

03:16.430 --> 03:17.130
Yi Bu,

03:18.520 --> 03:20.730
show some real skill.

03:54.360 --> 03:55.610
This is the Wanjuan Tower.

03:55.610 --> 03:56.750
[Wanjuan Tower]

03:56.750 --> 03:57.890
In this residence,

03:58.430 --> 03:59.610
it's the most heavily guarded.

04:00.750 --> 04:01.540
To get inside,

04:02.430 --> 04:04.220
I must draw those experts away.

04:32.270 --> 04:32.810
Uncle Zhe,

04:33.950 --> 04:34.490
you're here.

04:36.070 --> 04:37.250
On my way,

04:37.560 --> 04:39.340
I got your message to the Patriarch.

04:40.630 --> 04:41.220
So...

04:41.950 --> 04:43.460
we really plan to kill the Prince of Langya?

04:46.600 --> 04:47.370
Back in Blood River,

04:48.270 --> 04:49.410
that isn't a contract

04:50.190 --> 04:51.780
I'd ever take.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.100
Besides,

04:53.390 --> 04:54.370
he's of the Xiao imperial line,

04:54.390 --> 04:55.540
first in three generations.

04:56.270 --> 04:57.370
He's not an easy kill.

04:59.950 --> 05:00.810
What's your plan?

05:01.510 --> 05:03.140
First we'll pretend to bargain with the Shadow Sect.

05:04.680 --> 05:06.370
We have to visit the Wanjuan Tower.

05:06.830 --> 05:07.660
We must find a way

05:08.120 --> 05:10.100
to shatter the Shadow Sect in one strike,

05:11.070 --> 05:11.850
then pull away

05:11.870 --> 05:13.140
most of their forces,

05:13.800 --> 05:14.610
enter Wanjuan Tower,

05:15.870 --> 05:16.780
and destroy every record

05:16.800 --> 05:17.610
on Blood River.

05:18.560 --> 05:19.340
That way,

05:19.720 --> 05:21.140
Blood River can be a guild

05:22.190 --> 05:23.490
born and raised in the jianghu.

05:27.600 --> 05:29.460
Yi Bu wants to use us

05:29.480 --> 05:30.490
to kill the Prince of Langya.

05:31.680 --> 05:32.580
That means he's scared.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.340
So we'll do

05:34.390 --> 05:35.340
the opposite:

05:35.870 --> 05:37.370
use the Prince of Langya

05:37.920 --> 05:38.810
to wipe out the Shadow Sect.

05:42.720 --> 05:44.100
I thought the battle at Jiuxiao City

05:44.430 --> 05:45.290
was the end of it all.

05:46.510 --> 05:47.980
After surviving this time,

05:48.870 --> 05:50.460
will there be another hurdle?

05:51.270 --> 05:52.250
Where there are people,

05:52.630 --> 05:53.540
there's a jianghu.

05:54.390 --> 05:55.610
Where there's a jianghu,

05:56.360 --> 05:57.250
there's conflict.

05:57.800 --> 05:58.610
Besides,

05:59.000 --> 06:01.100
you've got a brother who loves a good fight.

06:02.120 --> 06:02.810
When will he arrive?

06:03.510 --> 06:04.700
I've already sent word

06:05.360 --> 06:06.580
about Tianqi City.

06:07.160 --> 06:08.370
Once he's ready,

06:08.950 --> 06:09.930
he'll enter Tianqi.

06:10.920 --> 06:12.020
In that case,

06:12.950 --> 06:14.900
we'll wait a few days.

06:16.190 --> 06:17.020
Compared to us,

06:17.680 --> 06:19.110
that Shadow Sect lot

06:19.160 --> 06:20.700
won't be sitting easy.

06:21.950 --> 06:23.520
Since we're in Tianqi,

06:24.000 --> 06:25.050
I'll take you around

06:25.120 --> 06:26.290
to some fun spots.

06:26.920 --> 06:28.660
The most famous places in Tianqi City?

06:29.190 --> 06:30.780
I've made the rounds these days.

06:32.190 --> 06:32.930
Oh yeah? Which ones?

06:34.430 --> 06:35.490
Thousand-Gold Tower,

06:36.310 --> 06:37.270
the Imperial Astronomical Bureau,

06:37.360 --> 06:38.170
the Heaven-Querying Stone,

06:38.360 --> 06:39.050
Dragon-Ascending Garden.

06:39.630 --> 06:40.780
I even stopped by the academy.

06:41.310 --> 06:41.980
Hold it.

06:43.600 --> 06:45.100
What kind of boring spots are those?

06:47.040 --> 06:48.170
They're the most famous sites

06:48.190 --> 06:49.220
in all of Tianqi City.

06:53.190 --> 06:53.930
When it comes

06:53.950 --> 06:54.900
to the truly famous place,

06:56.070 --> 06:57.210
it should be...

06:57.480 --> 06:58.120
The Imperial Palace?

06:58.310 --> 06:59.610
The Entertainment Street.

07:09.950 --> 07:11.030
Su Changhe?

07:11.360 --> 07:12.020
What brings you here?

07:12.430 --> 07:13.370
I'm going to find Su Muyu.

07:13.630 --> 07:14.220
Want to come along?

07:15.760 --> 07:17.040
- Kites! - Fresh buns!

07:17.040 --> 07:18.800
- Kites for sale! - Take a look!

07:19.540 --> 07:20.720
Kites in every style!

07:20.720 --> 07:21.480
Muyu,

07:21.950 --> 07:23.100
you come all the way to Tianqi

07:23.390 --> 07:24.730
and don't even stroll through here?

07:26.360 --> 07:26.900
I...

07:28.040 --> 07:28.580
I don't know the way.

07:30.240 --> 07:30.980
Fair point.

07:31.560 --> 07:32.730
A place like this,

07:33.040 --> 07:34.170
you'll always get lost alone.

07:34.870 --> 07:35.660
Before lust can bewitch you,

07:35.800 --> 07:36.610
you're already lost here.

07:38.950 --> 07:39.460
Uncle Zhe...

07:42.000 --> 07:43.220
how come you started drinking?

07:45.480 --> 07:46.980
Because it makes me look dashing.

07:48.120 --> 07:48.810
How come so fluent

07:48.830 --> 07:49.850
in standard speech now?

07:51.000 --> 07:52.540
Why do you care?

07:53.160 --> 07:53.850
Then Uncle Zhe,

07:54.480 --> 07:55.250
where are we going

07:55.800 --> 07:56.460
next from here?

07:58.240 --> 08:00.250
At Pleasure House flowers bloom,

08:00.750 --> 08:02.780
when they bloom beauties arrive.

08:03.360 --> 08:05.050
Of course, we're going to Pleasure House.

08:08.220 --> 08:17.620
[Pleasure House]

08:19.680 --> 08:20.170
Uncle Zhe,

08:22.600 --> 08:24.220
you really set me up.

08:25.000 --> 08:25.540
You didn't tell me

08:25.600 --> 08:26.960
it's this kind of place!

08:28.000 --> 08:29.050
Sir!

08:36.080 --> 08:37.400
A cup from a beauty

08:37.630 --> 08:38.820
is surely the finest wine.

08:45.720 --> 08:46.530
Sir...

08:57.060 --> 08:59.060
[Pleasure House]

08:59.080 --> 08:59.530
Uncle Zhe,

09:00.240 --> 09:01.120
what now?

09:01.550 --> 09:02.190
What do we do?

09:02.630 --> 09:03.420
What do you want to do?

09:03.960 --> 09:04.610
I want to leave.

09:11.510 --> 09:13.370
Is this your first time here, Sir?

09:15.200 --> 09:15.610
Yes.

09:16.840 --> 09:17.980
For a gentleman like you

09:18.030 --> 09:19.010
to grace my place,

09:19.080 --> 09:20.770
you shall have whatever you desire.

09:21.670 --> 09:22.730
Today,

09:22.840 --> 09:24.220
do whatever you please here,

09:24.910 --> 09:26.250
and you won't have to pay

09:26.320 --> 09:27.370
a single tael.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.370
What would you like to do?

09:32.960 --> 09:33.890
I already said it.

09:34.600 --> 09:35.340
I want to leave.

09:39.030 --> 09:40.010
You want to leave?

09:40.790 --> 09:41.460
But...

09:42.790 --> 09:44.060
the uncle beside you

09:44.080 --> 09:45.250
seems keen to stay.

09:47.150 --> 09:47.730
Muyu,

09:48.240 --> 09:49.220
we're already here,

09:49.440 --> 09:50.300
so enjoy yourself.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.650
How about going in to hear a tune?

09:58.840 --> 09:59.580
I don't mind

09:59.600 --> 10:01.610
you sipping the priciest wine

10:01.630 --> 10:03.200
or choosing the prettiest girl.

10:03.270 --> 10:04.370
I only worry when you ask for music.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.790
The last one who came for a tune

10:06.790 --> 10:08.440
was Xueyue City's Third City Lord,

10:08.440 --> 10:09.600
Sikong Changfeng.

10:10.440 --> 10:11.570
He walked off

10:11.570 --> 10:13.060
with my top-earning girl.

10:14.000 --> 10:14.530
You're teasing me.

10:18.360 --> 10:19.340
But Sir,

10:20.150 --> 10:20.980
today,

10:22.000 --> 10:23.580
it hasn't even rained outside.

10:24.270 --> 10:26.010
So why bring an umbrella?

10:29.790 --> 10:30.650
I'm guessing

10:32.440 --> 10:34.130
it's your weapon.

10:35.940 --> 10:37.300
To enjoy music here,

10:37.480 --> 10:38.610
no weapons inside.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.180
Let me hold it for you.

10:45.120 --> 10:46.430
Second Master, perfect timing.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.750
Come give me a hand

10:47.750 --> 10:48.690
with our new friend.

10:49.960 --> 10:50.580
Sure!

10:51.000 --> 10:51.420
This way, please!

10:53.390 --> 10:53.890
Go on.

10:59.440 --> 11:00.100
After you, please.

11:01.020 --> 11:07.540
[Pleasure House]

11:12.630 --> 11:13.210
Here.

11:13.550 --> 11:13.940
Have a seat.

11:22.300 --> 11:25.070
[Wan'er of Pleasure House]

11:25.070 --> 11:27.240
Mr. Jiang, you're right...

11:28.910 --> 11:30.250
I'm Tu Wan of Thousand-Gold Tower.

11:30.880 --> 11:32.690
[Tu Wan of Thousand-Gold Tower]
May I ask your name?

11:33.480 --> 11:34.100
Su Muyu.

11:36.150 --> 11:36.980
Muyu...

11:37.720 --> 11:38.300
Good name!

11:38.670 --> 11:39.340
A fine name indeed!

11:49.870 --> 11:51.250
Su Muyu, the Umbrella Ghost?

11:55.080 --> 11:56.700
Today I'm just Su Muyu here,

11:57.150 --> 11:58.310
not the "Umbrella Ghost".

12:01.000 --> 12:01.670
Don't worry.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.340
I'm just here to enjoy the music.

12:04.240 --> 12:05.300
Ah, Mr. Su...

12:06.440 --> 12:07.130
such tasteful leisure!

12:13.380 --> 12:17.820
[Tianqi]

12:22.000 --> 12:23.060
I wonder

12:23.080 --> 12:23.730
what Su Muyu

12:24.120 --> 12:25.340
is up to now.

12:28.320 --> 12:29.570
Mr. Chang, another cup.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.720
Come on!

12:30.750 --> 12:31.630
Drink up!

12:32.910 --> 12:34.590
This tune today is truly good!

12:34.720 --> 12:36.100
Worth the trip...

12:37.600 --> 12:38.940
Do you often visit for music?

12:40.480 --> 12:42.180
I used to.

12:43.000 --> 12:44.720
Back then Miss Feng, a true virtuoso,

12:44.720 --> 12:45.580
held court here.

12:46.240 --> 12:47.530
Since Miss Feng left,

12:48.080 --> 12:48.980
I haven't come for a long time.

12:50.080 --> 12:52.100
Now the one at the zither is Miss Wan'er.

12:52.240 --> 12:53.190
They said

12:53.190 --> 12:54.850
her playing isn't beneath Miss Feng's.

12:55.200 --> 12:55.850
So I came to listen.

12:59.240 --> 13:00.060
How does it feel?

13:01.720 --> 13:02.770
In my heart

13:03.030 --> 13:04.250
she still falls short of Miss Feng,

13:05.600 --> 13:06.450
but indeed

13:06.480 --> 13:08.150
she's already remarkable.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.160
What do you think?

13:12.440 --> 13:13.260
As for music,

13:13.910 --> 13:15.010
I only appreciate it.

13:15.870 --> 13:16.840
I have no standing

13:16.840 --> 13:17.840
to judge others.

13:18.870 --> 13:19.250
I...

13:23.150 --> 13:23.820
Let's talk later,

13:24.150 --> 13:25.490
or Miss Wan'er will be upset.

13:34.750 --> 13:36.820
Seems this "top assassin"

13:37.320 --> 13:38.490
isn't so terrifying.

13:38.490 --> 13:40.020
He even feels quite friendly.

13:40.720 --> 13:41.700
Maybe the rumors

13:41.750 --> 13:42.850
exaggerate too much,

13:43.150 --> 13:45.100
or only if he draws his blade

13:45.120 --> 13:46.180
he turns into a demon.

13:47.030 --> 13:47.580
Forget it.

13:48.240 --> 13:49.420
Let me enjoy the music.

13:50.030 --> 13:51.010
I'll slip out when there's a chance.

13:58.480 --> 13:59.650
Where did you pick up

13:59.720 --> 14:01.530
such a handsome young lad,

14:03.000 --> 14:04.580
and so brave, too?

14:05.150 --> 14:06.530
Look how he's hooked

14:06.550 --> 14:07.530
the hearts of our girls.

14:09.000 --> 14:10.490
He's a junior of mine.

14:11.120 --> 14:12.180
I want to see

14:12.510 --> 14:14.100
if he's a reliable man.

14:15.480 --> 14:15.980
What,

14:16.960 --> 14:18.850
does making merry in my house

14:18.850 --> 14:20.570
mean he isn't reliable?

14:22.960 --> 14:24.460
Why test a man on that?

14:25.790 --> 14:26.780
Oh, I forgot to tell you.

14:27.240 --> 14:28.660
I've found my daughter.

14:29.790 --> 14:31.200
That's wonderful.

14:32.120 --> 14:33.300
Isn't that what you've wished for

14:33.360 --> 14:34.530
all these years?

14:36.360 --> 14:37.100
It is.

14:39.480 --> 14:40.490
But ever since

14:41.000 --> 14:42.300
my girl met this boy,

14:42.670 --> 14:44.370
I feel she's taken a liking to him.

14:45.200 --> 14:46.110
As for the boy,

14:46.120 --> 14:47.570
I watched him grow up.

14:47.790 --> 14:49.560
He's solid in everything else,

14:49.840 --> 14:51.570
but when it comes to love,

14:51.570 --> 14:52.800
I don't know him at all.

14:53.440 --> 14:54.460
Then has the kid

14:55.150 --> 14:56.700
passed your test now?

14:58.000 --> 15:00.180
At this house of temptation,

15:00.680 --> 15:01.690
he only hears music.

15:02.320 --> 15:03.540
Now I'm at ease.

15:05.870 --> 15:07.020
But to me,

15:08.630 --> 15:09.500
this kid

15:10.470 --> 15:12.260
may be cold all his life.

15:14.520 --> 15:15.570
Didn't you predict

15:15.680 --> 15:17.140
I'd die halfway down this path?

15:17.440 --> 15:18.420
Yet I'm safe now.

15:21.520 --> 15:22.610
I've even had a daughter.

15:24.590 --> 15:25.690
Our family

15:26.080 --> 15:27.540
is changing in a big way.

15:28.710 --> 15:29.660
This kid

15:29.990 --> 15:30.970
can surely change

15:31.040 --> 15:32.090
that so-called fate.

15:33.440 --> 15:34.610
In that case,

15:34.710 --> 15:35.300
shouldn't we

15:35.350 --> 15:36.570
celebrate properly?

15:37.520 --> 15:37.930
Come on.

15:39.110 --> 15:40.330
Here, a toast to you.

15:48.470 --> 15:49.330
I've got girls here

15:49.590 --> 15:50.380
who favor

15:50.750 --> 15:52.450
heroes like you.

15:53.110 --> 15:55.020
You're now a widower anyway,

15:55.520 --> 15:56.810
your so-called "test"

15:58.160 --> 15:58.930
hardly matters.

16:04.100 --> 16:07.580
[Yi's Residence]

16:10.040 --> 16:10.450
Sir,

16:11.080 --> 16:11.690
The Three Officials are back.

16:12.560 --> 16:13.330
Let them in.

16:17.320 --> 16:18.330
Impressive, Sir.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.090
You should've been

16:20.160 --> 16:21.850
the hardest shadow to spot,

16:22.350 --> 16:24.090
yet you hold the glorious public face

16:24.590 --> 16:26.780
of the Imperial Father-in-Law.

16:27.440 --> 16:28.660
What nonsense are you babbling?

16:28.920 --> 16:29.380
Crow, stop.

16:32.950 --> 16:33.690
I heard

16:34.340 --> 16:35.580
your talks with Su Muyu

16:35.580 --> 16:36.970
fell through.

16:42.400 --> 16:44.140
But at Yellow Springs Pawnshop,

16:45.040 --> 16:46.570
we ran into Su Changhe.

16:47.230 --> 16:48.210
From our talk,

16:48.800 --> 16:49.900
I got the sense

16:50.560 --> 16:51.810
that compared to Su Muyu,

16:52.350 --> 16:54.330
this Patriarch now in power

16:54.990 --> 16:56.020
is the better

16:56.080 --> 16:57.090
partner.

17:03.040 --> 17:04.170
You're sure

17:04.800 --> 17:06.610
you can negotiate with Su Changhe?

17:07.870 --> 17:08.650
Yes.

17:10.080 --> 17:11.610
He puts profit first,

17:12.760 --> 17:13.260
which is why

17:13.910 --> 17:15.470
he became Patriarch

17:15.470 --> 17:16.170
in the end.

17:16.870 --> 17:17.700
And the only person

17:18.080 --> 17:19.810
who can make him set profit aside

17:19.960 --> 17:21.090
and act on feeling

17:22.190 --> 17:22.740
just happens

17:23.390 --> 17:25.330
to have entered Tianqi early.

17:28.910 --> 17:30.780
If we seize Su Muyu first,

17:31.670 --> 17:32.540
then our terms with Su Changhe

17:32.590 --> 17:34.220
gain leverage.

17:35.430 --> 17:36.330
By then,

17:36.350 --> 17:37.460
emotionally

17:37.480 --> 17:38.220
and in profit,

17:38.590 --> 17:40.090
he will have to work with us.

17:40.960 --> 17:41.610
Then,

17:42.190 --> 17:43.410
we can throw

17:43.480 --> 17:45.020
the full might of Blood River

17:45.430 --> 17:46.850
to kill a prince

17:46.910 --> 17:47.610
in Tianqi City.

17:51.040 --> 17:52.170
Whether Blood River

17:52.240 --> 17:53.300
survives after that

17:54.320 --> 17:55.890
no longer matters.

17:58.390 --> 17:59.020
Good.

18:00.000 --> 18:01.330
Then change the plan.

18:02.150 --> 18:03.850
No more waiting for Su Muyu's reply.

18:04.430 --> 18:04.980
Tonight,

18:05.520 --> 18:07.060
throw him into the Shadow Prison!

18:08.670 --> 18:09.370
As you command.

18:19.720 --> 18:20.090
Sir,

18:20.670 --> 18:21.260
Should we inform

18:21.480 --> 18:23.020
the First Prince?

18:23.960 --> 18:24.500
No need.

18:28.960 --> 18:30.940
I've got a bad feeling:

18:32.520 --> 18:33.780
the First Prince

18:34.760 --> 18:35.460
has already grown

18:35.480 --> 18:36.890
dismissive of us.

18:37.720 --> 18:39.170
We must do something

18:40.320 --> 18:41.130
to show him

18:42.480 --> 18:43.410
our sect's strength.

18:44.390 --> 18:46.700
Our sect may not be what it was,

18:47.670 --> 18:49.220
but it still has the strength

18:49.350 --> 18:51.090
to defend Tianqi City.

18:58.240 --> 18:59.540
Catching Su Muyu

19:01.040 --> 19:02.940
is the perfect chance.

19:23.960 --> 19:24.410
Good!

19:24.630 --> 19:28.540
- Good! - Good!

19:29.800 --> 19:30.090
Here!

19:34.080 --> 19:34.650
Much obliged, Sir!

19:37.040 --> 19:37.610
Mr. Zhou, after you.

19:37.670 --> 19:38.370
Here, take mine!

19:39.630 --> 19:40.780
Oh, you brought no silver?

19:40.960 --> 19:42.060
No worries. I've got it!

19:43.910 --> 19:44.650
Thank you, Sir!

19:46.170 --> 19:46.780
Buddy,

19:47.150 --> 19:48.090
come with me in a bit.

19:48.560 --> 19:49.370
Know the gambling house?

19:49.670 --> 19:51.170
The biggest in Tianqi City!

19:51.560 --> 19:52.090
My family runs it.

19:52.630 --> 19:53.370
I'll help you win some money.

19:54.960 --> 19:56.260
So you're the type

19:57.080 --> 19:57.740
who calls everyone "buddy"

19:57.760 --> 19:58.980
after a drink.

20:05.390 --> 20:06.260
I've long heard

20:06.320 --> 20:07.370
of your name.

20:07.560 --> 20:09.780
They called you some "human fiend".

20:10.080 --> 20:11.500
Didn't expect you

20:11.630 --> 20:13.330
to be a dashing young man!

20:15.240 --> 20:16.740
We just click, don't we?

20:16.960 --> 20:17.810
How about we...

20:20.830 --> 20:21.170
Who's there?

20:21.520 --> 20:22.940
Who dares kill in Tianqi City?

20:27.720 --> 20:28.740
Who's sneaking around,

20:28.910 --> 20:29.650
shooting from the dark?

20:33.240 --> 20:34.170
This has nothing to do with you.

20:34.560 --> 20:35.260
Who are you,

20:35.670 --> 20:36.410
playing at spooks?

20:36.800 --> 20:37.540
Second Master, please step back.

20:38.080 --> 20:39.170
He's here for me.

20:40.630 --> 20:41.940
So he's your enemy?

20:43.590 --> 20:45.020
Not exactly.

20:45.960 --> 20:47.540
They once belonged to Blood River.

20:48.110 --> 20:49.020
Then what ghosts are they?

20:49.350 --> 20:50.310
They're not "ghosts".

20:50.720 --> 20:52.540
They're the "deities" in temples.

20:53.110 --> 20:54.500
Only we who bear swords

20:54.560 --> 20:55.410
are called "ghosts",

20:56.080 --> 20:57.090
the so-called

20:57.150 --> 20:58.090
"human fiends".

21:00.080 --> 21:00.780
I don't really get it.

21:02.430 --> 21:03.700
Sounds scary, anyway.

21:04.350 --> 21:05.020
Not really.

21:06.720 --> 21:08.300
But Uncle Zhe took my sword.

21:09.910 --> 21:11.020
That's a hassle.

21:16.670 --> 21:17.330
Usually,

21:17.350 --> 21:18.410
I don't use weapons,

21:18.590 --> 21:19.500
just this dagger

21:19.630 --> 21:21.060
for emergencies.

21:24.390 --> 21:24.890
Good.

21:25.870 --> 21:27.020
I often see Changhe

21:27.040 --> 21:27.810
use the Inch Sword.

21:28.830 --> 21:30.810
I didn't expect it'd come in handy today.

21:33.480 --> 21:33.960
Mr. Su,

21:34.000 --> 21:34.850
another friend of yours

21:34.870 --> 21:35.850
came with you, didn't he?

21:36.150 --> 21:36.650
Yes.

21:37.670 --> 21:38.570
Make it a livelier fight,

21:39.040 --> 21:39.850
drag it out,

21:40.150 --> 21:41.090
and stall for Uncle Zhe.

21:42.280 --> 21:43.460
He won't.

21:44.390 --> 21:45.020
Second Master, stand down.

21:45.320 --> 21:46.170
This has nothing to do with you.

21:50.910 --> 21:51.370
Zi,

21:51.430 --> 21:52.810
you're generous.

21:53.280 --> 21:54.700
To celebrate me finding my daughter,

21:54.910 --> 21:56.460
you sent four ladies to serve me.

21:57.280 --> 21:58.890
Trying to take this old life of mine?

22:00.430 --> 22:02.410
Serve Mr. Su well,

22:02.590 --> 22:03.260
got it?

22:03.590 --> 22:04.330
Yes.

22:05.150 --> 22:05.700
Then,

22:06.150 --> 22:06.980
I'm off now.

22:07.590 --> 22:08.370
Go on.

22:18.870 --> 22:20.020
Mr. Su.

22:22.520 --> 22:23.370
Ladies,

22:23.520 --> 22:24.650
you may leave too.

22:25.000 --> 22:26.740
I may be visiting the Entertainment Street,

22:27.190 --> 22:28.330
but I'm not that kind of man.

22:29.150 --> 22:30.410
I've got a daughter now.

22:31.430 --> 22:32.540
Then let me

22:32.670 --> 22:34.170
see you off

22:34.560 --> 22:35.850
to supreme bliss.

22:39.350 --> 22:40.020
I said

22:40.080 --> 22:40.890
I'm not that kind of man.

22:48.320 --> 22:48.980
I'm past the age

22:49.000 --> 22:50.460
of falling for honey traps.

23:09.560 --> 23:10.060
Careful!

23:10.390 --> 23:11.170
That's an Immortal Brush.

23:11.430 --> 23:12.130
Every word on the floor

23:12.190 --> 23:12.940
[Characters]
is a strand of qi.

23:13.150 --> 23:14.220
The qi will be guided by the brush later.

23:14.430 --> 23:15.540
He's probing for your weak point!

23:15.870 --> 23:16.500
Too chatty.

23:24.830 --> 23:25.260
Second Master,

23:25.590 --> 23:26.220
leave at once.

23:26.630 --> 23:27.130
Mr. Su,

23:27.320 --> 23:28.570
I'll repay this life-saving debt.

23:28.830 --> 23:29.980
Watch yourself.

23:33.190 --> 23:33.650
Rise.

23:33.650 --> 23:34.700
[Loyal Unto Death]

23:38.860 --> 23:39.700
[Death]

23:43.500 --> 23:44.380
[Loyal]

23:46.940 --> 23:48.500
[Death]

23:49.860 --> 23:50.420
[Sacrifice]

23:59.020 --> 24:00.460
[Honored in Life, Mourned in Death]

24:01.320 --> 24:02.170
The Immortal Brush

24:03.080 --> 24:04.570
writes nothing but death.

24:05.040 --> 24:06.610
Because today is the day you die.

24:07.040 --> 24:08.130
Even immortals can't save you!

24:16.630 --> 24:17.170
Watch out!

24:24.960 --> 24:25.540
This is bad.

24:39.000 --> 24:40.610
How can they really go for the kill?

24:40.660 --> 24:41.460
[Death]

25:02.740 --> 25:03.860
[Swift Rain]

25:04.940 --> 25:07.180
[Sword in left hand]

25:09.860 --> 25:11.460
[Bow stance, right-finger sword]

25:21.320 --> 25:21.700
Watch out!

25:25.630 --> 25:26.130
Su Muyu!

25:26.630 --> 25:27.410
What are you doing?

25:30.060 --> 25:31.340
[Death]

25:32.780 --> 25:35.500
[Death]

25:37.560 --> 25:38.500
You're catching the Immortal Brush barehanded?

25:38.720 --> 25:39.650
Do you have a death wish?

25:57.670 --> 25:58.740
Truly the famed heir

25:58.800 --> 25:59.890
of No-Sword City,

26:00.520 --> 26:01.780
you even master the finger-sword.

26:02.190 --> 26:03.500
But this sword art

26:04.080 --> 26:05.260
hurts both foe and self.

26:06.320 --> 26:07.330
If you let it lapse,

26:08.520 --> 26:10.610
one finger-blade ruins one finger.

26:11.240 --> 26:12.610
I have nine fingers left.

26:14.110 --> 26:15.610
That's nine arcs of sword energy.

26:16.830 --> 26:18.540
Three arcs to kill one man

26:19.800 --> 26:20.540
is plenty.

26:46.480 --> 26:47.330
Su Muyu,

26:47.760 --> 26:48.940
after tasting mortal life,

26:49.000 --> 26:49.650
you really changed.

26:50.110 --> 26:51.410
You even dared visit the Entertainment Street!

26:52.480 --> 26:53.650
Your father brought me here!

26:56.320 --> 26:56.980
I can vouch.

26:57.240 --> 26:58.740
Mr. Su truly just came to hear music.

27:00.690 --> 27:01.310
So...

27:01.800 --> 27:03.280
he might actually be innocent?

27:03.280 --> 27:04.220
Naturally.

27:09.590 --> 27:11.220
Coming here just to hear songs,

27:11.560 --> 27:12.330
like me going

27:12.390 --> 27:14.260
to Tianqi's Diaolou Cottage

27:14.590 --> 27:15.650
and ordering a cup of tea.

27:16.280 --> 27:17.260
Know what that's called?

27:18.040 --> 27:18.500
What?

27:19.190 --> 27:21.060
"Having it both ways".

27:22.830 --> 27:23.650
"Acting on the spot".

27:24.960 --> 27:25.330
Second Master,

27:25.560 --> 27:26.540
help me look after Miss Bai.

27:28.000 --> 27:28.330
All right.

27:28.720 --> 27:30.300
You still have time to butt in mid-fight?

27:30.480 --> 27:31.610
Worry about yourself first.

27:34.110 --> 27:34.610
Take this!

27:35.480 --> 27:36.090
Put it

27:36.150 --> 27:37.090
on your injured finger.

27:50.000 --> 27:50.460
Thanks!

27:54.110 --> 27:54.700
Miss Bai?

27:55.110 --> 27:55.650
Bai Hehuai,

27:55.910 --> 27:57.220
Medicine King Xin Baicao's senior.

27:58.590 --> 27:59.300
An honor.

27:59.910 --> 28:00.700
Honor what?

28:01.190 --> 28:01.910
I've never even shown up

28:01.910 --> 28:02.970
in the jianghu.

28:03.040 --> 28:04.130
Quit the nonsense!

28:04.520 --> 28:05.390
So I don't buy

28:05.390 --> 28:05.940
what you just said either!

28:06.530 --> 28:07.150
No, I...

28:08.950 --> 28:09.460
Miss,

28:09.670 --> 28:10.300
you've got me

28:10.320 --> 28:11.500
at a loss for words.

28:20.240 --> 28:21.500
You don't seem

28:21.760 --> 28:23.220
too worried about Mr. Su.

28:23.800 --> 28:24.460
Of course.

28:25.040 --> 28:25.740
The moment

28:25.800 --> 28:27.300
Su Muyu has a sword in hand,

28:27.800 --> 28:28.890
the outcome is set.

28:32.320 --> 28:33.060
Aren't you coming down to help?

28:35.000 --> 28:35.610
Coming.

28:54.870 --> 28:55.300
What...

28:55.430 --> 28:56.700
what now?

28:57.280 --> 28:58.410
It's the Lone Void Array.

29:02.520 --> 29:03.330
Reinforcements.

29:04.110 --> 29:05.130
Who is it?

29:05.830 --> 29:07.130
The Blood River Patriarch,

29:07.480 --> 29:08.740
the Mu family head,

29:08.820 --> 29:09.480
and...

29:09.480 --> 29:09.930
Well...

29:10.000 --> 29:11.120
I'll be off now.

29:11.390 --> 29:12.130
What's the rush?

29:12.430 --> 29:13.020
Watch till the end.

29:18.080 --> 29:18.940
Miss Bai,

29:19.110 --> 29:19.610
see you later!

29:19.870 --> 29:20.650
Until we meet again!

29:32.390 --> 29:33.090
Su Muyu!

29:34.560 --> 29:35.410
Master Su,

29:36.190 --> 29:37.060
never thought you'd be subdued

29:37.110 --> 29:38.370
by my Drunken Dream Bone,

29:38.430 --> 29:39.060
did you?

29:42.590 --> 29:43.260
Stop!

29:45.590 --> 29:46.170
Su Changhe,

29:46.240 --> 29:47.170
why were you blocking me?

29:47.830 --> 29:49.020
Why not save Su Muyu?

29:49.390 --> 29:50.570
Su Changhe,

29:50.870 --> 29:52.310
if you want to save Su Muyu,

29:52.430 --> 29:55.130
follow the Shadow Sect's plan.

29:56.860 --> 29:58.580
[Yi's Residence]

30:08.720 --> 30:09.500
He's poisoned?

30:10.760 --> 30:11.810
He's been dosed with Drunken Dream Bone.

30:12.630 --> 30:14.300
Even if he's an immortal,

30:15.040 --> 30:16.500
he can't use a shred of martial skill.

30:32.480 --> 30:34.460
His qi is mild and slack,

30:35.910 --> 30:37.460
as if falling into a drunken dream

30:37.910 --> 30:39.810
that never ends.

30:43.240 --> 30:44.540
Indeed poisoned with what you said.

30:46.670 --> 30:47.700
You two did well.

30:49.320 --> 30:49.890
Guards,

30:50.560 --> 30:52.650
throw Su Muyu into the Shadow Prison.

30:53.000 --> 30:53.540
Yes.

31:05.590 --> 31:06.500
However,

31:08.350 --> 31:09.810
why are there only two of you?

31:11.960 --> 31:12.570
Where's Earth Official?

31:13.590 --> 31:14.370
He's dead.

31:15.150 --> 31:16.500
After all, taking Su Muyu alive

31:17.280 --> 31:18.740
is no easy task.

31:20.590 --> 31:21.300
A pity.

31:25.870 --> 31:26.410
Heaven Official,

31:27.390 --> 31:28.700
why so quiet?

31:30.590 --> 31:31.890
A brother died,

31:32.630 --> 31:34.330
and to you, it's only "a pity".

31:35.630 --> 31:36.700
But to me,

31:37.080 --> 31:37.940
it's far more

31:38.000 --> 31:39.130
than just that word.

31:40.080 --> 31:40.940
I have nothing more to say.

31:41.910 --> 31:43.090
Why press me?

31:45.590 --> 31:46.740
I see.

31:48.280 --> 31:49.220
Sorry.

31:49.670 --> 31:50.500
I overstepped.

31:53.910 --> 31:55.020
By the way, Mr. Yi,

31:56.960 --> 31:58.260
there's more good news

31:58.320 --> 31:59.300
to tell you.

32:02.830 --> 32:03.610
What news?

32:06.110 --> 32:08.460
Su Changhe, Blood River's Patriarch,

32:09.870 --> 32:10.330
by now...

32:11.000 --> 32:12.260
he has entered Tianqi City.

32:16.280 --> 32:16.780
Your Highness,

32:17.280 --> 32:18.850
there was a clash at the Entertainment Street.

32:19.320 --> 32:21.060
It was between the Shadow Sect's Three Officials

32:21.150 --> 32:21.740
and Su Muyu.

32:21.960 --> 32:22.980
Then Blood River's Patriarch,

32:23.110 --> 32:23.890
Su Changhe, arrived,

32:24.240 --> 32:24.940
but too late.

32:25.560 --> 32:26.850
The Earth Official was slain by Su Muyu.

32:27.870 --> 32:28.980
Su Muyu was hit with Drunken Dream Bone

32:29.390 --> 32:30.260
and taken by the Shadow Sect.

32:36.910 --> 32:38.330
Those Shadow Sect losers

32:39.480 --> 32:41.060
actually managed a win.

32:42.630 --> 32:44.500
We work with the Shadow Sect

32:44.800 --> 32:45.850
only to use them

32:45.910 --> 32:47.740
as Blood River's whetstone.

32:48.280 --> 32:49.460
We'll wipe them out after,

32:49.760 --> 32:51.370
and gain Blood River,

32:51.480 --> 32:53.260
a sharper blade.

32:53.800 --> 32:55.940
Pity that the Three Officials are strong,

32:56.520 --> 32:58.810
no weaker than the family heads of the Blood River.

32:59.480 --> 33:01.370
And earlier, their stance

33:01.800 --> 33:03.570
seemed reluctant to clash

33:03.630 --> 33:05.260
with Blood River head-on.

33:06.430 --> 33:09.370
Why the sudden change?

33:15.760 --> 33:16.890
How come the Shadow Prison

33:17.430 --> 33:18.500
is so empty?

33:22.080 --> 33:23.130
The Shadow Sect

33:23.190 --> 33:24.940
once guarded Tianqi as its shadow.

33:25.760 --> 33:26.890
But when the light blazes brightest,

33:27.350 --> 33:28.060
and even the night

33:28.080 --> 33:28.980
is lit,

33:29.630 --> 33:31.060
there's no need for shadows.

33:32.630 --> 33:33.500
Now the Prince of Langya

33:33.560 --> 33:34.890
holds the power

33:34.960 --> 33:36.220
to guard Tianqi and all of Beili.

33:36.960 --> 33:38.060
So the Shadow Sect

33:38.630 --> 33:39.810
has little reason

33:39.830 --> 33:40.610
to keep prisoners.

33:41.560 --> 33:42.500
Some were even taken away

33:42.560 --> 33:43.610
soon after they arrived

33:44.390 --> 33:46.020
by the Prince of Langya.

33:46.960 --> 33:47.570
No wonder

33:47.630 --> 33:49.130
Yi Bu is so bent on killing the Prince of Langya.

33:54.960 --> 33:57.260
You can still talk after being poisoned?

33:57.830 --> 33:58.300
This toxin

33:58.350 --> 33:59.460
is no ordinary one.

34:00.830 --> 34:01.570
These past hours,

34:02.430 --> 34:03.940
I've tried to rouse my qi

34:04.830 --> 34:06.170
and break the shackle inside.

34:07.480 --> 34:08.460
But till now,

34:10.080 --> 34:11.770
I can barely speak.

34:13.150 --> 34:14.060
Figures.

34:14.630 --> 34:16.290
This is my proudest creation.

34:21.270 --> 34:22.250
Among the Three Officials,

34:23.270 --> 34:24.250
you're the most unusual.

34:25.590 --> 34:26.690
Besides Water Official,

34:28.310 --> 34:29.570
what else are you?

34:30.790 --> 34:32.210
My name is Su Henshui.

34:33.630 --> 34:35.020
I want to live for myself,

34:36.920 --> 34:37.860
not sit like a statue

34:37.920 --> 34:39.570
in a temple,

34:39.750 --> 34:41.380
nor be a blade in another's hand.

34:43.480 --> 34:44.130
I see.

34:48.630 --> 34:49.130
Who?

34:53.710 --> 34:55.290
Worthy indeed

34:56.110 --> 34:57.420
of Blood River's Patriarch,

34:57.440 --> 34:58.060
you sensed my presence.

34:58.710 --> 34:59.290
Who are you?

35:00.110 --> 35:00.820
I'm Crow

35:01.630 --> 35:02.170
from Shadow Sect.

35:04.110 --> 35:05.900
I heard you've arrived this city,

35:06.360 --> 35:07.290
so I came to pay respects.

35:08.270 --> 35:09.340
Where is Su Muyu?

35:10.310 --> 35:11.500
He asked me to wait here.

35:11.560 --> 35:13.210
Why isn't he here?

35:13.880 --> 35:15.210
You want to see Su Muyu?

35:15.360 --> 35:15.940
Of course.

35:17.150 --> 35:18.540
He's the Su family head,

35:18.590 --> 35:19.380
my best friend

35:19.440 --> 35:20.690
for life.

35:21.110 --> 35:21.940
Even if I lose

35:21.960 --> 35:23.060
the Patriarch's seat,

35:23.110 --> 35:23.820
I won't allow him

35:23.880 --> 35:25.090
the slightest harm.

35:25.440 --> 35:27.170
If any of you touch him,

35:28.480 --> 35:30.250
and I'll fight you to the end.

35:33.440 --> 35:35.170
No need to be so tense, Sir.

35:35.560 --> 35:36.900
Su Muyu is currently

35:36.960 --> 35:38.500
a guest at our sect.

35:39.230 --> 35:40.210
He's fine.

35:41.750 --> 35:42.570
Only...

35:45.440 --> 35:46.210
Only what?

35:47.000 --> 35:48.250
Such killing intent...

35:48.560 --> 35:49.170
Speak!

35:50.790 --> 35:51.500
Only what?

35:52.960 --> 35:54.770
Only that a guest can become

35:55.710 --> 35:57.290
the host or a prisoner.

35:58.000 --> 35:58.570
All depends

35:59.480 --> 36:01.570
on your sincerity.

36:07.480 --> 36:08.420
My "sincerity"?

36:09.190 --> 36:10.610
Testing my sincerity

36:11.520 --> 36:13.420
shows none of yours.

36:15.040 --> 36:16.610
And it's dangerous.

36:19.480 --> 36:20.860
Danger is all

36:22.190 --> 36:23.610
we ever deal in,

36:23.670 --> 36:24.940
isn't it?

36:27.520 --> 36:29.210
Well said.

36:29.880 --> 36:31.340
I'm almost impressed.

36:33.110 --> 36:33.570
Speak...

36:35.190 --> 36:36.130
what do you want from us?

36:37.590 --> 36:38.650
We want you

36:39.360 --> 36:41.340
to take the head of the Prince of Langya.

36:41.960 --> 36:42.460
What?

36:43.520 --> 36:44.650
Do you even know what you're saying?

36:46.040 --> 36:46.820
Blood River kills anyone,

36:46.840 --> 36:48.210
doesn't it?

36:49.790 --> 36:51.200
I'll put

36:51.230 --> 36:52.560
the hardest man to kill

36:52.560 --> 36:53.540
before you.

36:54.310 --> 36:55.340
No need to

36:55.340 --> 36:56.020
rush your answer.

36:56.520 --> 36:57.580
Think it over and...

36:58.920 --> 36:59.420
And?

37:01.480 --> 37:03.020
If you turn your head,

37:03.920 --> 37:04.730
will it

37:04.790 --> 37:05.650
fall off?

37:09.340 --> 37:12.820
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

37:12.860 --> 37:16.740
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

37:18.580 --> 37:22.060
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

37:22.100 --> 37:25.940
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

37:27.940 --> 37:31.220
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

37:31.340 --> 37:33.420
♪Still I can't let go♪

37:33.580 --> 37:37.020
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

37:37.500 --> 37:39.700
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:39.820 --> 37:44.820
♪No one can escape from love♪

38:01.420 --> 38:05.140
♪How many hidden feelings♪

38:05.260 --> 38:09.340
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

38:10.580 --> 38:14.460
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

38:14.580 --> 38:18.820
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

38:19.940 --> 38:22.820
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

38:22.900 --> 38:27.140
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

38:29.420 --> 38:33.420
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

38:33.460 --> 38:36.900
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

38:38.420 --> 38:41.860
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

38:41.940 --> 38:45.740
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

38:47.660 --> 38:51.100
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

38:51.140 --> 38:54.980
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

38:57.020 --> 39:00.260
